  "content": "\n\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d;text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1249361/description_cec7763e-9b9c-4911-803f-d8d120b212c6.png\">尋找按鈕 2</strong></span></span></h1>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>英文版</strong></span></h2>\n<p><strong>在這個 Minecraft 地圖中，你的目標是在每個房間找到一個隱藏的按鈕以繼續前進。每個房間都設計了一個隱藏的功能性按鈕，你必須找到它才能解鎖下一關。探索每個角落，仔細檢查並運用你的智慧來發現它的位置。有些房間可能有巧妙的藏身處和視覺把戲，所以請睜大眼睛。你能找到所有按鈕並完成地圖嗎？🚀</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>它包含 25 個關卡，分佈在 Minecraft 的每個維度中<br><br>第一部分：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft-bedrock/maps/find-the-button-plus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft-bedrock/maps/find-the-button-plus</a><br></strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>教學：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fyoutu.be%252fUGY9KF_DSaM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://youtu.be/UGY9KF_DSaM</a></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>作者：@d_de_diego_d</strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1249361/description_cec7763e-9b9c-4911-803f-d8d120b212c6.png\"></p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>西班牙文版</strong></span></h2>\n<p><strong>在這個 Minecraft 地圖中，你的目標是在每個房間找到一個隱藏的按鈕以繼續前進。每個房間都設計了一個隱藏的功能性按鈕，你必須找到它才能解鎖下一關。探索每個角落，仔細檢查並運用你的智慧來發現它的位置。有些房間可能有巧妙的藏身處和視覺把戲，所以請睜大眼睛。你能找到所有按鈕並完成地圖嗎？</strong>🚀</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>本地圖共有 25 個關卡，涵蓋 Minecraft 的各個維度。</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 第一部分：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft-bedrock/maps/find-the-button-plus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft-bedrock/maps/find-the-button-plus</a></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>教學：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fyoutu.be%252fUGY9KF_DSaM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://youtu.be/UGY9KF_DSaM</a></strong></span></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>作者：@d_de_diego_d</strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1249361/description_cec7763e-9b9c-4911-803f-d8d120b212c6.png\"></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>❤️ 支持我 ❤️</strong></h2>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/wURmd9P3qq\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/MehVahdJukaar/dynamic_badges/blob/master/discord.svg?raw=true\" alt=\"Supplementaries Discord\" width=\"180\" height=\"62\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpaypal.me%252fddediegod%253fcountry.x%253dES%2526locale.x%253des_ES\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1232953/description_68549b52-a129-4666-80cb-67f09f5db302.png\" alt=\"在 Patreon 上支持我\" width=\"205\" height=\"70\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.tiktok.com%252f%2540texturepacks_mc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1232953/description_24a6377c-de2d-48a7-a0a9-5c2642f644cb.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"56\"> </a><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@d_de_diego_d\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/MehVahdJukaar/dynamic_badges/blob/master/youtube.svg?raw=true\" alt=\"YouTube 頻道\" width=\"207\" height=\"60\"></a></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftridex.webnode.es%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1232953/description_caf0ba8d-3249-447f-b3b8-6507248fbba5.png\" width=\"200\" height=\"59\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fadfoc.us%252f%253frefid%253d871639\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1232953/description_163a7545-bbf3-47c9-817b-4423c2d5688d.p